# Twilda — Expo (global)

- **Package:** `@artometrics/twilda`. Prefer `@/` imports mapped to `src/` then project root (`tsconfig.json`).
- **Routes:** Expo Router under `app/`. Tabs for Library / Journal / Account; stack for novel workspace and journal entry.
- **UI:** Reuse `src/components/ui.tsx` and theme tokens in `src/constants/theme.ts` before adding one-off markup.
- **Data:** Domain services live in `src/lib/{novels,journal,auth,supabase}` — call Supabase directly under RLS.
- **Scope:** Keep changes minimal and consistent with surrounding files; avoid drive-by refactors or unrelated formatting.
- **Support links:** Use README placeholders when relevant — [Documentation](https://lexingtonthemes.com/documentation/quick-start/), [Support](https://lexingtonthemes.com/legal/support/).
